 life, plus fun facts. (Although some of Jamie's shows are adult, this game is completely family-friendly.)  Or if you're not particularly a fan, just enjoy finding the objects, 52 in all: Helicopter, submarine, wolf, sheriff's car, wooden sword, ice cream cone, stethoscope, camera, microphone, metal detector, ambulance, and more, even the kitchen sink.\n\nFull version; no ads; no IAPs; no data collected about you nor your device. Just plain fun!\n", "short_description": "Find the hidden objects on this beautiful tropical island, exploring land, sea, and air.  Game is re-playable multiple times, with object locations shuffled. Includes (family-friendly) Jamie Dornan tribute. Helicopter, submarine, wolf, sheriff's car, wooden sword, ice cream cone, and more.  Full version; no ads; no IAPs; no data collected about you nor your device. Just plain fun!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_8owt359ta8z20HrlFwpUNmGU0hSXmLHNNXKcCddKss/edit?tab=t.0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Elisa Collins", "support_website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XGptkBnxxB1ABqM1vvT23Z8V0HM4cLCeUfBjPnjcURY/edit?tab=t.0", "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XGptkBnxxB1ABqM1vvT23Z8V0HM4cLCeUfBjPnjcURY/edit?tab=t.0", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes